        "question_MKaVVf": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I contact your customer care team?",
            "answer": "<p>Please contact us at - <a href=\"mailto:info@thepromiseco.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:info@thepromiseco.com\">info@thepromiseco.com</a> and we will do our best to help. Please provide y<strong>our order number</strong> if possible and as much information  regarding your request. <br/><br/>Our customer service hours are <strong>9am-5pm (UK time) Monday - Friday</strong>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long will my order take to dispatch?",
            "answer": "<h5><strong>Order Fulfilment:</strong></h5><ul><li>Orders are shipped <strong>Monday–Friday</strong>.</li><li>Any orders placed after <strong>1pm (local warehouse time)</strong> on Fridays, will not be shipped until Monday.</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Ready To Wear Pieces:<br/></strong>If the item is in stock and your order is placed <strong>before 1pm </strong>(local warehouse time). The order will be fulfilled on the same day. </p><p><strong>Made To Order - Custom Lab:<br/></strong>These unique items are crafted just for you so once your order is placed - <strong>please allow 2-3 weeks for dispatch of your order.</strong></p><p>Please note dispatch times are an estimate and may occasionally be extended due to busy periods, sales, or UK/ USA public holidays.</p><p>If you have any questions or need any additional help, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:info@thepromiseco.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:info@thepromiseco.com\">info@thepromiseco.com</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "question_XkktdC": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does delivery take?",
            "answer": "<h5><strong>UK Shipping (from our UK warehouse)</strong></h5><ul><li><strong>Royal Mail 24 Hours</strong>: Delivery in 1 working day (order before 1pm GMT to receive your parcel the next working day).</li><li><strong>Royal Mail 48 Hours</strong>: Delivery in 2 working days.</li></ul><p></p><h5><strong>USA Shipping (from our USA warehouse)</strong></h5><ul><li>Orders ship via <strong>DHL Express Domestic</strong>.</li><li>Delivery takes <strong>1–4 working days</strong>, depending on your shipping zone.</li><li>All tariffs and import fees are already covered by <strong>The Promise Ring Co. LTD</strong>, so there are <strong>no additional customs charges</strong> for US customers.</li></ul><h5><strong>International Shipping (all other countries from our UK warehouse)</strong></h5><ul><li><strong>Europe</strong>: 2–11 business days.</li><li>Orders under €150 (excluding shipping fees) ship with no import fees</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Canada, Australia & ROW</strong>: 3–17 business days.</li></ul><p><strong>Please note:</strong> Delivery times are estimates and may occasionally be extended due to customs delays, courier disruptions, or UK/ USA public holidays.<br/><br/>If you have any questions or need any additional help, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:info@thepromiseco.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:info@thepromiseco.com\">info@thepromiseco.com</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "question_NwzYNY": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is my item covered by a  warranty?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, all products are covered by a 5-year warranty to give you complete peace of mind against any manufacturing faults or defects.  <br/><br/>These pieces aren't just jewellery; they are symbols of love, commitment, and cherished moments.</p><p>That's why we stand by our products. Full warranty terms <a href=\"https://thepromiseco.com/pages/5-year-warranty\" title=\"https://thepromiseco.com/pages/5-year-warranty\">here</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3eWW9D": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer express delivery?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>Express Delivery</strong></p><ul><li><strong>UK Customers</strong> – Next Working Day delivery available with Royal Mail (order before 1pm GMT).<br/></li><li><strong>USA Customers</strong> – Express shipping available nationwide, delivered in 1<strong>–4 business days</strong>. (Order before 1pm MST)</li></ul><p>If you require your order sooner, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:info@thepromiseco.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:info@thepromiseco.com\">info@thepromiseco.com</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "question_VG7jyh": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I update or cancel my order once I have placed it?",
            "answer": "<p>We move quickly to get your order to you, so there's only a short window to make changes. Just email <a href=\"mailto:info@thepromiseco.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:info@thepromiseco.com\">info@thepromiseco.com</a> as soon as you can and we'll do our best to help.</p><p><strong>Ready To Wear:</strong><br/><br/>If your order hasn't been dispatched yet, we can usually help with changes like your address, ring size or a swap. Once it's left the warehouse, we're unable to make changes - but you're covered by our standard 30-day returns. </p><p><strong>Made To Order - Custom Lab:</strong><br/><br/>You have <strong>60 minutes after ordering to amend your details</strong> - your engraving, birthstone, size or anything else. Just email us within that hour and we'll update it for you.<br/><br/>After 60 minutes, your piece moves into production, so it <strong>can't be amended or cancelled</strong> — and because each Lab piece is made just for you, Lab orders can't be cancelled at all once placed. This is why we ask you to check everything on your confirmation screen before you order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_UmtchC": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are there be duties or custom fees?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>UK Customers:<br/></strong>No duties or fees apply.<br/><br/><strong>USA Customers:</strong><br/>Thanks to our new US warehouse, there are <strong>no tariffs or additional fees</strong> on your orders.<br/></p><p><strong>EU Customers:</strong> <br/><strong>Orders under €150 </strong>(plus shipping fees) ship with <strong>no import fees.<br/><br/></strong>If the items in your basket exceed €150 (before shipping) please see below<br/><br/><strong>Other International Customers:</strong> Deliveries outside of the UK and USA may be subject to customs fees, duties and taxes. These vary by country, and unfortunately we cannot control or predict the charges. For more information, please contact your local customs office. <br/>Please note, we are not able to reimburse duties or taxes paid upon delivery. </p>"
          }
        },
        "question_amCgdd": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "My items have different delivery timeframes?",
            "answer": "<p>If your order contains multiple items with different delivery timeframes, your entire order will follow the longest delivery date.</p><p>For example, if you order a ready to wear piece and a custom piece, both items will arrive in one parcel when the custom piece is finished, 2-3 weeks after placing your order.</p><p>To help reduce packaging waste and unnecessary shipments, we do not split ship orders. Everything will be sent together once the final item is ready.<br/><br/>If you require additional support with this please contact us and we will do our best to help - <a href=\"mailto:info@thepromiseco.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:info@thepromiseco.com\">info@thepromiseco.com</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "category_nUYzNF": {
          "type": "category",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Made to order",
